    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=dvntl18w2i]{color:#091e42} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=dvntl18w2i]{color:#bdd2f6}[data-colorid=j0gx8l9r4j]{color:#091e42} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=j0gx8l9r4j]{color:#bdd2f6}[data-colorid=y3lwxuv6v8]{color:#091e42} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=y3lwxuv6v8]{color:#bdd2f6}[data-colorid=ea5gt465ps]{color:#091e42} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=ea5gt465ps]{color:#bdd2f6}[data-colorid=aun076p1h8]{color:#091e42} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=aun076p1h8]{color:#bdd2f6}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"BedManagement-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This feature provides the ability to admit, discharge and transfer a patient. A patient can be assigned to a selected bed. The bed details can also be viewed including tags. This is a new features that replaces the old ADT/IPD module since V0.91.</span></p><h2 id=\"BedManagement-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This feature is used by the IPD nurses to monitor the admitted patients.</span></span></p><p><br /></p><h2 id=\"BedManagement-HowisitUsed?\">How is it Used?</h2><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"039ed5c2-fe3a-4472-9373-81898730314b\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Configure the feature by following the steps mentioned <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/707854444/Bed+Management+Module\" data-linked-resource-id=\"707854444\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a>&nbsp;&amp; by creating the Bed Types and Ward Layout in <strong>Admin</strong> here: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/712507393/Ward+Management+Admin+Console\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bed Layout Management</a>. Once you have done you will find the following link for the app in the home page.</p></div></div><p><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/Bahmni_Home.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535483651246&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=100&amp;height=89\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/Bahmni_Home.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535483651246&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"707461206\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Bahmni_Home.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"2ad7fef5-07c1-43d4-8fff-4d279a0a7702\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/Bahmni_Home.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535483651246&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=200&amp;height=178 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/Bahmni_Home.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535483651246&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=100&amp;height=89 1x\" /></span></p><p><span data-colorid=\"j0gx8l9r4j\">If you click on app, you will navigate to Patient List/Queue page where you can see the patients to be admitted, patients who are already admitted and patients who to be discharged etc. This queues are configurable.&nbsp;</span><span data-colorid=\"ea5gt465ps\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049631143&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=636&amp;height=150\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049631143&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"716537857\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"list.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"6d0cd492-69b9-40ef-a51d-389b7ddcc918\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049631143&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1272&amp;height=300 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049631143&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=636&amp;height=150 1x\" /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span data-colorid=\"dvntl18w2i\">You will also see a link 'Bed Management' which will show you the views of wards - ward layout or a list view.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span data-colorid=\"y3lwxuv6v8\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535484079766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=687&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/IPD_and_Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535484079766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"707330205\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"IPD_and_Bahmni.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"6fbb9497-0e4c-4fac-87fb-b46cd475b69f\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535484079766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1374&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535484079766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=687&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span data-colorid=\"aun076p1h8\">From the queues, if you would select any patient, you will be forward to the the page shown below, where you can choose a ward and within it a bed, where you may assign a bed for the patient.&nbsp;If you want&nbsp;to admit the patient, you maybe prompted like below if the patient had a visit different than IPD.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Edit_-_Bed_Management_-_Bahmni_Documentation_Wiki.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535711385031&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=611&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/IPD_and_Edit_-_Bed_Management_-_Bahmni_Documentation_Wiki.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535711385031&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712474628\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"IPD_and_Edit_-_Bed_Management_-_Bahmni_Documentation_Wiki.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"e815e35b-c7cf-4cd7-8552-49846a089ffc\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Edit_-_Bed_Management_-_Bahmni_Documentation_Wiki.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535711385031&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1222&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD_and_Edit_-_Bed_Management_-_Bahmni_Documentation_Wiki.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1535711385031&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=611&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>From the patient queue, upon selection of an admitted patient, you will be taken to the ward view displaying the patient details. You may select another bed in the same ward or at a different location and initiate a transfer process if such is the disposition given.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/transfer.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049663342&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=568&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/transfer.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049663342&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"716341291\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"transfer.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"b0acc213-ca91-488e-a0c9-ed24b03d9222\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/transfer.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049663342&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1136&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/transfer.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1536049663342&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=568&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>Or discharge an admitted patient&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD.png?version=10&amp;modificationDate=1536049381408&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=698&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/707559542/IPD.png?version=10&amp;modificationDate=1536049381408&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"708739142\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"IPD.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"707559542\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"8096d18b-94b1-4b7c-bdc4-70d7907db81e\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD.png?version=10&amp;modificationDate=1536049381408&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1396&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/707559542/IPD.png?version=10&amp;modificationDate=1536049381408&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=698&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e4e357ee-8b8f-40f4-8c33-40938be496b2\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"7bc68d4f-56d9-4b21-9fb8-29196731c055\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div>&nbsp;<p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"698d4a82-5bc7-4a13-a03e-2c6d4414d8f7\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/712507393/Ward+Management+Admin+Console\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Ward Management Admin Console</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-widt